    <node id="Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems">
      <data key="d0">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A publication series where "Overfitting in neural nets" (2001) and "Shallow vs. deep sum-product networks" (2011) were published.&lt;SEP&gt;A conference publication covering research in neural information processing systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems is a conference proceeding where the paper on Imagenet classification was published.&lt;SEP&gt;This publication featured the paper "Attention Is All You Need."</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f509e07c140db54396c0dd6295e0be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-366a439420ac0344c697dc0460ffa8aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-588116b5242516d003d1e70d48a7f42c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f63a01dc7031890756e399578cff0a</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285215</data>
    </node>
