    <node id="Artificial Intelligence">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificial Intelligence (AI) is a field of study whose tools are crucial for the fast and accurate analysis of electric designs.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI) is the field focused on building intelligent machines capable of learning from examples, experiences, or other machines.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-610e0748724855c847b8fd20690e22db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6410a69aa370e2358cfa5bfe581796</data>
