      <data key="d0">US GHG Emissions by Sector</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">US GHG Emissions by Sector is data illustrating greenhouse gas emissions in the US by different sectors, shown as Figure 3.2.&lt;SEP&gt;Data representing greenhouse gas emissions in the US, categorized by sector.&lt;SEP&gt;The concept illustrated by the pie chart which shows the distribution of Greenhouse Gas emissions across various sectors in the United States.</data>
