    <node id="US Transportation Sector GHG Emissions by Source">
      <data key="d0">US Transportation Sector GHG Emissions by Source</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Data detailing greenhouse gas emissions within the US transportation sector, broken down by source.&lt;SEP&gt;US Transportation Sector GHG Emissions by Source is data illustrating greenhouse gas emissions from the US transportation sector by source, shown as Figure 3.3.&lt;SEP&gt;This is the title of a 3D exploded pie chart that illustrates the distribution of greenhouse gas emissions within the US transportation sector.</data>
