    <node id="2010 Toyota Prius IPM Motor">
      <data key="d0">2010 Toyota Prius IPM Motor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The IPM motor from a 2010 Toyota Prius, for which an efficiency map is discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The 2010 Toyota Prius IPM Motor is an electric motor whose efficiency map is displayed in the image, showing its performance across various speeds and torques.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-172d2c57a19dd33adf49cb4619a788cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288928</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Efficiency Maps">
      <data key="d0">Efficiency Maps</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Maps that represent the efficiency of a motor.&lt;SEP&gt;Data representing efficiency, used as the original training data for a pre-trained network.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency Maps are generated for motor geometries, detailing the performance under various conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency maps are calculated for each motor sample and used for training deep learning models.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency Maps are the final output of the process, generated by post-processing and interpolating calculated points, representing the efficiency of a system.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency maps are contour plots that visualize the efficiency levels of IPM motors, ranging from 0 (dark blue) to 0.9 (bright yellow), across different speed (Nm) and torque (Tm) values.&lt;SEP&gt;Efficiency maps are visual representations of the efficiency of components or systems, in this case, for an IPM motor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9ce70f04fc1f66c450a145e83381de84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee3a2fda6147e62f8093cb1da810ea6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-564505ebb053f0e31b0cfdaa812556ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a73228cc9dfee94628a2eb077e2a4a4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc05caebd47f0bf32bdc510804373755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28be27ccbb95fc691bf7d1ab7fac43a1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288737</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Process for Calculating Efficiency Maps">
      <data key="d0">Process for Calculating Efficiency Maps</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
