      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A method for predicting flux linkage using a neural network.&lt;SEP&gt;This is the overarching concept illustrated by Figure 3.7, involving the use of neural networks to predict DQ flux linkages.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-17fa5f6a446284811fca7ceb6337e9ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
