      <data key="d0">RNN with Attention Mechanism</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific neural network architecture, a Recurrent Neural Network with an attention mechanism.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a part of the neural network architecture shown in Figure 3.8(a), designed to encode long-term dependencies and mitigate information loss.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a0dd4b73a53d12770e110415d865cc0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
