      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An additional neural network used for maximum Torque and Speed prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;The Supplementary Neural Network is designed to predict maximum torque and speed.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0b7e7c8729e5eef7f4ff08e29b1d0014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
