    <node id="Flux Linkage (D-Axis) Map">
      <data key="d0">Flux Linkage (D-Axis) Map</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A map of flux linkage along the d-axis, obtained from deep learning (DL) and finite element (FE) methods.&lt;SEP&gt;The Flux Linkage (D-Axis) Map visualizes the relationship between `λ_d [mWb]`, `I_q [A_RMS]`, and `I_d [A_RMS]`, and is obtained from both Deep Learning and Finite Element analysis.</data>
