      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Curves illustrating the training progress for supervised prediction of efficiency maps.&lt;SEP&gt;This concept refers to the graphical representation of how machine learning models improve their accuracy over training epochs when predicting efficiency maps.</data>
