      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Data showing the distribution of normalized error.&lt;SEP&gt;Normalized Error Distribution is a concept represented by a heatmap showing the distribution of errors, with positive, negative, and central values depicted by colors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8c85d4390c7f5cda3bb7e9cc87cbcec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
