      <data key="d5">1760289402</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Normalized Uncertainty Map">
      <data key="d0">Normalized Uncertainty Map</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A map illustrating normalized uncertainty levels.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation of uncertainty, highlighting regions of high uncertainty.&lt;SEP&gt;A normalized uncertainty map shows the uncertainty levels for a design sample using MC dropout.&lt;SEP&gt;A Normalized Uncertainty Map visualizes the level of uncertainty in predictions, derived from methods like Bayesian Inference.&lt;SEP&gt;Normalized Uncertainty Map is a heatmap indicating levels of uncertainty, with colors representing higher or lower uncertainty values.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8c85d4390c7f5cda3bb7e9cc87cbcec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92cc2b02ae3a119d92f0d1a7f6617885&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289157</data>
    </node>
