      <data key="d0">Parametrized Motor Geometry of FSCW PM Motor</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The parametrized motor geometry of a Fractional Slot Concentrated Winding Permanent Magnet (FSCW PM) motor.</data>
