    <node id="Midha et al. 2019">
      <data key="d0">Midha et al. 2019</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Midha et al. 2019 refers to a research publication authored by Midha and colleagues in 2019. This work serves as a significant reference and benchmark in various studies, particularly concerning design optimization results. It is frequently cited in relation to the design and dimensioning of C-core actuators and their armatures, providing exemplary information for these components.

The publication describes an ON/OFF based topology optimization (TO) algorithm and its associated post-processing filters. Furthermore, it discusses the application of Genetic Algorithms (GA) and GA+ filters for evolutionary optimization, specifically within electromagnetic actuators that incorporate simultaneous material selection. It is used as a benchmark for comparison with new sequence-based TO methods, particularly in linear case scenarios (e.g., 70 N).&lt;SEP&gt;Midha et al. 2019 refers to a publication that is cited as the source for the result with Average filtering.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3639a9f481dea165d73df49859233cf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1757cd493f052e1f9528255eb34ea59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9268a7feb5bb249a1838bc7743ffa61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cc8202063f67533ab2523d99cadd60f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5526ac278068ab9cbf72c11fd3817672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b63cf0d438e93eb8fd05fc3ffbbb91e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288823</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Optimized Design">
      <data key="d0">Optimized Design</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A design that has been improved through optimization processes.&lt;SEP&gt;An optimized design is a design that is generated after performing numerous analyses to achieve peak performance or efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;The optimized design is the final 3D rendering of the topology-optimized bracket, featuring a skeletal and organic structure with reduced mass.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3d608386f6581f290b37ee1f8bb75e40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-592244534b4a5f40cf1d7d58a26d28cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fac0a146871deda05d5134b0c361666</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289322</data>
    </node>
