      <data key="d2">Varying coil turns are considered in the experiment setup.&lt;SEP&gt;Coil turns is a parameter for the coil, specified as 500 for C-core Excitation Scenario 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Coil Turns, represented as (T), is a component of the C-core excitation scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Coil turns is a parameter (250) used in the excitation scenario for the electromagnetic actuator.&lt;SEP&gt;Coil Turns is a parameter of the excitation, specified as 500 in the surrounding content and for the specific sequence.&lt;SEP&gt;The number of turns in the coil, specified at 500 turns, contributing to the excitation scenario.</data>
