      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">500 Amp-Turns is an excitation level where the effect of saturation is dominant, relevant for agent policy formation.&lt;SEP&gt;500 Amp-Turns is an excitation level derived from the coil current and coil turns, at or below which saturation is not dominant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-24ad8c5c524179d51552952772945627&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
