      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Flux distribution inside an electric motor for different operating conditions is essential at the design stage for performance prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;Flux distribution is one of the results of computation in FEA.&lt;SEP&gt;Flux distribution refers to the pattern of magnetic flux, providing information for the agent to form a policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Flux Distribution is a factor that the intelligent agent considers to manage material non-linearity based on excitation levels.</data>
