    <node id="Electric Machines">
      <data key="d0">Electric Machines</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Electric machines, including motors and generators, are energy conversion devices crucial in various applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Electric machines are the subject of design and analysis through statistical algorithms and intelligent agents.&lt;SEP&gt;Electric machines are devices that are modeled using various methods like MEC, FEA, and FDM.&lt;SEP&gt;Electric machines are devices whose performance can be predicted using various modeling techniques, including Machine Learning and Finite Element Methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Electric machines are core components of industrial machinery and the power industry, found in appliances and industrial equipment. They consume a significant portion of global electricity and are crucial for energy conservation and sustainable development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05d9b6a613299c6224fd2160377cbc33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f3d168f1b6a8020e0606ef52cd19390&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74285f9f1c2db4a1aaef011e90f166c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
