    <node id="Sources of Errors">
      <data key="d0">Sources of Errors</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Sources of errors are various factors that can introduce inaccuracies in numerical methods like FEA, such as rounding-off and insufficient discretization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
