      <data key="d0">Limited Modeling Capabilities</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Limited modeling capabilities refer to constraints in how accurately a model can represent reality, contributing to errors in FEA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
