    </node>
    <node id="Insufficient Discretization of the Mesh">
      <data key="d0">Insufficient Discretization of the Mesh</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Insufficient discretization of the mesh is a source of error in FEA, where the model's grid is not fine enough.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285293</data>
    </node>
    <node id="FE-Based Simulator">
      <data key="d0">FE-Based Simulator</data>
      <data key="d1">software</data>
      <data key="d2">A FE-based simulator is a software tool that uses Finite Element Analysis to provide solutions, which are accepted as ground truth in the industry.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
