    <node id="Modern Mathematical Methods">
      <data key="d0">Modern Mathematical Methods</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Modern mathematical methods, enabled by data and computational resources, allow tackling previously unattainable challenges.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75365c11d58d9301541e75f2ba5f03ec</data>
