      <data key="d5">1760285315</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Dilated Filters">
      <data key="d0">Dilated Filters</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Dilated filters are a feature added to neural networks that significantly improve model performance by changing the behavior of constituent filters without increasing neuron count.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38ad7ba535a3b44f510acc91b0e8d5f1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285315</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Figure 2.9b">
      <data key="d0">Figure 2.9b</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 2.9b is a visual representation showing the effect of adding dilated filters to a neural network, leading to performance improvement.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 2.9b illustrates how a dilated filter captures spatially distant relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 2.9b is a specific part of Figure 2.9 that demonstrates how a dilated filter can capture spatially distant relationships.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1a4b902f2347e5fea9d43e606ce167ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31f3b0d30beebae149e306398e8c2b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38ad7ba535a3b44f510acc91b0e8d5f1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289018</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Kernel Size 5">
      <data key="d0">Kernel Size 5</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Kernel size 5 refers to a specific configuration for a network's kernel, mentioned in relation to its performance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38ad7ba535a3b44f510acc91b0e8d5f1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
