      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to standard designs for synchronous reluctance motors, including salient pole, axial lamination, and transverse lamination types.&lt;SEP&gt;Conventional rotor designs are illustrated for synchronous reluctance motors, showcasing different types such as salient pole, axial lamination, and transverse lamination.</data>
