    <node id="Deep Q-Learning">
      <data key="d0">Deep Q-Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">An extension of Q-learning that uses deep neural networks to approximate the Q-value function.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific algorithm within deep reinforcement learning for Q-learning.&lt;SEP&gt;An extension of Q-learning that uses deep neural networks to approximate the Q-function.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Q-learning (DQN) is a breakthrough success in applying deep learning to RL problems, combining Experience Replay, $\epsilon$-based exploration, and Q-learning to train a neural network.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Q-Learning is an advanced form of Q-learning that employs deep neural networks as function approximators to handle high-dimensional state and action spaces, overcoming limitations of tabular methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Q-Learning is an advanced reinforcement learning method that combines Q-learning with deep neural networks to overcome the curse of dimensionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Q-Learning is an algorithm used to determine the optimal geometry of the C-core, converging in approximately 950 episodes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceb1ac6e54fec53c601d8b38f2b338d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aa75c1dcbd4f8e8da642ba3e55f2a1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5072e2b75e9621e87c85e7af0ee60311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de02f58d9cc1d404c5da9c1f45b14fa6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4124ebf92b84af2f8bbaecff99882b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02a0921c09c7af3fdaeac2a38ff90bbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
