      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A Q-learning policy that consistently chooses a specific action (action 2 in this case), often associated with greedily selecting the action with the highest Q-value.&lt;SEP&gt;A greedy Q-Learning policy that always chooses Action 2, as depicted in Chart (a).</data>
