    <node id="NN">
      <data key="d0">NN</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">NN, or Neural Network, is a computing system inspired by the biological neural networks that constitute animal brains.&lt;SEP&gt;NN refers to Neural Networks, specifically in the context of predicting with uncertainty analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f5af4d3dcb1894cb22db778a1e1b744</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285391</data>
    </node>
    <node id="DNN">
      <data key="d0">DNN</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">DNN, or Deep Neural Network, is a neural network with multiple hidden layers.&lt;SEP&gt;DNN stands for Deep Neural Network, a type of neural network with more than one hidden layer, used here for training.&lt;SEP&gt;A DNN is a Deep Neural Network used by Deng, Qin, and Lu 2020 in an online fashion, trained with selectively collected data to accelerate computation as a surrogate of the objective function evaluator.&lt;SEP&gt;DNN refers to Deep Neural Networks, for which uncertainty analysis is performed using Bayesian learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f5af4d3dcb1894cb22db778a1e1b744&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285391</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ON/OFF Discrete Method">
      <data key="d0">ON/OFF Discrete Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The ON/OFF discrete method is a Topology Optimization algorithm that is compared to SeqTO in terms of computational resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8f5af4d3dcb1894cb22db778a1e1b744</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
