      <data key="d0">Simulated Annealing Algorithms</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A global optimization method commonly applied in the electromagnetic field.&lt;SEP&gt;Simulated annealing algorithms are a global optimization method applied in electromagnetic fields that eliminate inferior solutions and advance superior solutions through mutation and cross-over.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31b45185f3e33b63259454671f7614ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75b68f2c0143d85fc982bac91ab7a190</data>
