      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Heat Transfer is an engineering discipline involved in the complex design optimization process of electric machines, especially in multiphysics analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Heat transfer is a field where distributing materials to optimize performance is a significant topic.</data>
