      <data key="d0">Multiphysics Disciplines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Multiphysics disciplines are various fields mentioned where distributing materials to optimize performance is a significant topic.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31b45185f3e33b63259454671f7614ad</data>
