      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Midha is a researcher cited in 2018 in the context of discrete methods, where each element can assume a particular material or remain void.&lt;SEP&gt;Midha is a researcher associated with the non-smooth estimate of the topology boundary in homogenization methods and filtering techniques for density-based methods.</data>
