      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">3D printing is a technique that forms an ideal combination with homogenization for topology optimization due to its ease of manufacturing microstructure materials.&lt;SEP&gt;A general term for additive manufacturing processes, specifically mentioned in the context of creating complex and optimized structures.</data>
