    <node id="Osher">
      <data key="d0">Osher</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Osher is credited with developing the boundary based methodology for topology optimization in 1988, along with Sethian.&lt;SEP&gt;Osher is a researcher who, along with Sethian, developed the boundary variation methods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31b45185f3e33b63259454671f7614ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe80fce29c226462c0b0c6baffec8feb</data>
