    </node>
    <node id="Global Warming">
      <data key="d0">Global Warming</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The greatest challenge faced by the world, addressed by the Paris Climate Change Conference.&lt;SEP&gt;Global Warming is a critical environmental issue linked to increasing CO2 emissions and rising global temperatures.</data>
