      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The transportation sector is one of the largest contributors to GHG emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Transportation Sector is the largest contributor to US Greenhouse Gas (GHG) Emissions, representing 28.0% of emissions. In 2018, it accounted for 28% of total U.S. GHG emissions.</data>
