      <data key="d0">Power Factor Map</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of performance map that DL models can be explored for.&lt;SEP&gt;A power factor map is a target task in Internal Knowledge Transfer, replacing efficiency map prediction over the same IPM geometry.&lt;SEP&gt;A visual representation or data output derived from a Modified Neural Network, specifically related to the power factor of a motor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Power Factor Map is the output of the neural network and is represented by the contour plots.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-193c3a719cf23865bd32e0d110afb409&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d3e48fade88c3732bf1ffbbe240bea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d4389bce8e015dd342452266c2e8a65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfe7a5106e28df4677808f1339897e29</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
