      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A figure referenced in the text depicting Global Warming.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3.1 is an image composed of two line graphs, labeled (a) and (b), illustrating carbon dioxide emissions and global land-sea temperature increase.</data>
