      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A study performed under the UNFCCC, referenced for data on U.S. GHG emissions.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a technical report from 2018 published by the EPA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e2e27a9a79daf5a813690efa01766eca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d4389bce8e015dd342452266c2e8a65</data>
