      <data key="d0">Goodfellow, Bengio, and Courville (2016)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">This is a reference to a literature describing several activation functions and properties of CNNs.&lt;SEP&gt;Authors credited for ReLU and max-pooling references.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31f3b0d30beebae149e306398e8c2b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03395909e238b7701943add27146739b</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285450</data>
