      <data key="d2">Table 2.4 provides more information on the network and training dataset size.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 2.4 is titled 'Network and Training partition features' and presents key characteristics of a Deep Learning network architecture and the dataset used for its training and evaluation.</data>
