      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">This refers to a source that discusses Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) machines.&lt;SEP&gt;This refers to a publication cited in relation to the model's capacity to capture problem complexity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31f3b0d30beebae149e306398e8c2b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af</data>
