    <node id="Number of Layers">
      <data key="d0">Number of Layers</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The number of layers is a hyperparameter influencing model capacity and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Number of Layers refers to the total number of layers in the Deep Learning model, which is 32.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a177157c3402545cf649cdb67022050a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31f3b0d30beebae149e306398e8c2b1b</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
