      <data key="d0">Zhang et al. 2019</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A research paper that proposed a DL method using CNN and GANs for TO with generalizability by mapping physical fields instead of sparse boundary conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
