      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A computational model inspired by the structure of the human brain, used for learning complex patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing system inspired by the brain's neural networks, used in physics-informed deep learning to represent PDE solutions.</data>
