      <data key="d0">Performance Estimator</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A performance estimator is a role limited to ML algorithms by Deng, Qin, and Lu 2020 for compliance minimization, rather than as an optimization algorithm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
