      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Reinforcement learning that uses deep neural networks, introduced for TO to improve generalizability.&lt;SEP&gt;DRL is a technology applied in various fields, with applications demonstrated in Atari games, Game of Go, and Robotics.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Reinforcement Learning (DRL) is a type of machine learning that combines reinforcement learning with deep neural networks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3676b77d4e3057ccce502057364cbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5f6d6c8243089f59fe677475645a52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
