    <node id="Optimization Of IPM Motors">
      <data key="d0">Optimization Of IPM Motors</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Optimization of IPM motors is the process of improving the design of Interior Permanent Magnet motors, for which torque values are predicted.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Doi, Sasaki, And Igarashi 2019">
      <data key="d0">Doi, Sasaki, And Igarashi 2019</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Doi, Sasaki, and Igarashi 2019 refers to a research paper that further advanced Topology Optimization for Electromagnetics, focusing on reducing computational burden.&lt;SEP&gt;A research paper listed in Table 5.1.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3676b77d4e3057ccce502057364cbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289128</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Barmada Et Al. 2020">
      <data key="d0">Barmada Et Al. 2020</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Barmada et al. 2020 refers to a work on topology optimization of electric motors using deep neural networks.&lt;SEP&gt;Barmada et al. 2020 refers to a research paper that contributed to reducing the computational burden associated with FE analysis in Topology Optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;A research paper listed in Table 5.1.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3676b77d4e3057ccce502057364cbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d519cd75c14207ceeaef0cf84051a1d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-540fc8a4d14fea776a933c31f85916ab</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
