      <data key="d0">Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) is a type of synchronous AC machine.&lt;SEP&gt;Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) is a type of synchronous AC machine.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f6cebd0187b0c1924a3e6491e8ebe8</data>
