      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A Fractional-Slot Concentrated Winding Permanent Magnet (FSCW PM) is a type of synchronous AC machine.&lt;SEP&gt;Fractional-Slot Concentrated Winding Permanent Magnet (FSCW PM) is a type of synchronous AC machine.</data>
