    <node id="Design Spaces">
      <data key="d0">Design Spaces</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Design spaces of motor geometries are fed as inputs to DNNs.&lt;SEP&gt;Design Spaces are generated using methods like Latin Hypercube sampling and represent the range of possible motor designs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f6cebd0187b0c1924a3e6491e8ebe8</data>
