    <node id="Reference Designs">
      <data key="d0">Reference Designs</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Reference designs are baseline motor designs, whose parameters are varied for dataset generation.&lt;SEP&gt;Reference Designs are specific, fixed motor configurations used as a baseline or instance within a broader design space.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1f6cebd0187b0c1924a3e6491e8ebe8</data>
