      <data key="d0">Motor Characterization</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Motor characterization involves running electromagnetic finite element simulations at various dq currents for a given motor geometry and parameters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
