      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Pan and Yang 2009 is a reference (paper or book) that provides notation for defining a task of prediction using a ML model.&lt;SEP&gt;Pan and Yang 2009 refers to a publication that discusses the concept of transfer learning (TL).</data>
