      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Mou et al. 2016 is a reference (paper or book) that observed that very dissimilar tasks fail in the transfer learning process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mou et al. 2016 refers to a publication that describes how a pre-trained network can be adapted for a new task in transfer learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5d3e48fade88c3732bf1ffbbe240bea3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679159f51a7b3c245fdff9193fd1ef89</data>
