      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">An interior permanent magnet (IPM) is a type of synchronous AC machine studied in the context of transfer learning for electric motor drives.&lt;SEP&gt;Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) is a type of synchronous AC machine.</data>
