      <data key="d2">B distribution refers to the magnetic field distribution, optimized for excitation scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;B distribution, or magnetic flux density distribution, illustrates how magnetic fields are concentrated within the optimal geometry.&lt;SEP&gt;B Distribution, or magnetic flux density distribution, shows the magnitude and direction of the magnetic field within the C-core.&lt;SEP&gt;B Distribution refers to the magnetic field distribution, depicted as a false-color plot in the image.&lt;SEP&gt;B distribution refers to the magnetic field distribution, visualized using a heatmap and streamlines.&lt;SEP&gt;B Distribution, or magnetic flux density distribution, illustrates the strength and pattern of the magnetic field within and around the C-core actuator.&lt;SEP&gt;B Distribution refers to the visualization of magnetic field lines and intensity using continuous color gradients. It is labeled "Scaled Phi / Scaled T_mag (B)".</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2a5c42907185fecc94ee85f1b33ec380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2785b4e150ada39f3077e573325eeb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c8bce8440f0bbb7239189a9a4010d7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c48c238aedc178e88e075043138eb72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11edf0b881aae28423c1b0d33893b2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-081d5d2ff62504474fc8532dd817fb39</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289029</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Transformer Parameters">
      <data key="d0">Transformer Parameters</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transformer parameters are a set of data related to transformers, listed in Table 2.2.&lt;SEP&gt;Transformer Parameters are the dimensions (X, y, W, and yc) that define the physical characteristics of a transformer, with specified minimum and maximum values.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e98180b8e135e08cf842f2a94ed38a2</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289089</data>
    </node>
    <node id="IPM Motor Parameters">
      <data key="d0">IPM Motor Parameters</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">IPM Motor Parameters are a set of data related to Internal Permanent Magnet motors, listed in Table 2.3.&lt;SEP&gt;IPM Motor Parameters is a table (Table 2.3) that lists geometric parameters of an Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) motor, specifying minimum and maximum acceptable values for each parameter.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-997630dd5ed7d24f34fabba54a0e27c6</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289079</data>
    </node>
