      <data key="d0">FSCW PM Motor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">FSCW PM Motor stands for Fractional-slot Concentrated Winding Permanent Magnet Motor, for which a reference design's parameters are mentioned.&lt;SEP&gt;The FSCW PM Motor is a Fractional-Slot Concentrated Winding Permanent Magnet motor, which is the subject of the detailed imagery and analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f476972defaf212918b90b259aa69f03</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
