      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">These are constant parameters for Synchronous Reluctance Motors, listed in Table 4.5.&lt;SEP&gt;The SynRM fixed parameters are essential geometric and electrical specifications that define a synchronous reluctance motor, providing a baseline for topology optimization experiments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f0a87e071d0b56bc121b18a65c5875d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f519dcf3231dec106e81c35523ed6914</data>
