    <node id="On/Off TO">
      <data key="d0">On/Off TO</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">On/Off TO is a form of Topology Optimization compared with Seq based TO using GA and TD-learning.&lt;SEP&gt;On/Off TO is a type of topology optimization approach used by GA.</data>
