      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Researchers who observed that the performance of a network degrades if a single layer is removed.&lt;SEP&gt;Krizhevsky, Sutskever, and Hinton are researchers associated with developments in machine learning and big data, particularly in computer vision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1e3ef3a96efc33efd9047031ab15a09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285547</data>
    </node>
