    <node id="FEA Solution System">
      <data key="d0">FEA Solution System</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Finite Element Analysis solution system that handles identifying when input does not fit the problem description.&lt;SEP&gt;An FEA solution system is a method that can handle identifying when input does not fit the problem description.&lt;SEP&gt;The FEA (Finite Element Analysis) Solution System is an advanced computational method likely used for simulations of the IPM motor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-997630dd5ed7d24f34fabba54a0e27c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03395909e238b7701943add27146739b</data>
