      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) machine is one of the electromagnetic devices chosen as a problem with varying complexity for magnetic field estimation.&lt;SEP&gt;An Interior Permanent Magnet (IPM) machine is a type of electric motor discussed for its flexible operation at different speed and torque points with high efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-540fc8a4d14fea776a933c31f85916ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af</data>
