    <node id="Copper">
      <data key="d0">Copper</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">Copper is a material used in the coil and transformer coils, and in the IPM motor.&lt;SEP&gt;Copper is the material used for the coil.&lt;SEP&gt;Copper is the material from which the transformer's coils (windings) are made.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c59eba9d5ca580dfd954f743c22649a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e320c3afc0456b527186e2755a2ac4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03395909e238b7701943add27146739b</data>
