    <node id="Confusion Matrix">
      <data key="d0">Confusion Matrix</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A confusion matrix is a specific table layout that allows visualization of the performance of an algorithm, typically a supervised learning one.&lt;SEP&gt;A standard 2x2 matrix used for evaluating the performance of a classification model, organized by target and predicted classes. It defines the components necessary to calculate metrics like Classification Accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852a5b40a3022884df146775f2a7b320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b69dc7913a240aef52b550d176029b</data>
