    <node id="Precision and Recall">
      <data key="d0">Precision and Recall</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Precision and recall are metrics used to evaluate the performance of classification models, specifically not evaluated here due to lack of class imbalance.&lt;SEP&gt;Metrics often calculated from confusion matrices to address class imbalance, but not deemed necessary in this analysis due to balanced classes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-852a5b40a3022884df146775f2a7b320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b69dc7913a240aef52b550d176029b</data>
