      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A neural network approach for performance map prediction described in section 3.4.2.&lt;SEP&gt;The End-to-End Network Approach is a specific method within Neural Networks used for Prediction.&lt;SEP&gt;An alternative network training approach discussed, trained on the same GPU, showing similar performance to the modular approach.&lt;SEP&gt;The end-to-end network approach is the type of model described as generating the predictions.</data>
