      <data key="d5">1760289141</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Design Phase">
      <data key="d0">Design Phase</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Design Phase in the V-Design cycle is where product requirements are specified to perform simulation-based engineering design and optimization of subsystems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-610e0748724855c847b8fd20690e22db</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285609</data>
    </node>
