      <data key="d0">Synchronous Reluctance Motor Rotor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The rotor of a Synchronous Reluctance Motor is an example used for validating a method.&lt;SEP&gt;The Synchronous Reluctance Motor (SynRM) rotor is the specific component being optimized in the mathematical equation analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0011b0a6062b8a1499810eced96d7d94</data>
