      <data key="d0">SeqTO-vZ</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">SeqTO-vZ is a future modification of the Sequence-based Topology Optimization methodology, to be introduced in Chapter 5, Section 5.4.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
