    </node>
    <node id="Genetic Algorithm (GA)">
      <data key="d0">Genetic Algorithm (GA)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A metaheuristic approach for binary optimization problems inspired by natural selection, used for optimizing discrete design parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Genetic Algorithm is an optimization process used to explore the design space and find optimal designs for the C-core electromagnetic actuator.&lt;SEP&gt;A Genetic Algorithm (GA) is a methodology applied to the DESIGN SPACE of the C-core, used to optimize the core's material distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;A Genetic Algorithm (GA) is an optimization technique used with SeqTO-v1 to find the best configuration for the C-core electromagnet.&lt;SEP&gt;A Genetic Algorithm (GA) is an optimization method used to find the best solution for a problem, in this case, optimizing geometry.&lt;SEP&gt;Genetic Algorithm (GA) is an optimization method used to determine the optimal geometry of the Synchronous Reluctance Motor (SynRM).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-57172dfb9b0c90234ff04b1a5519b71e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6719c866b8100236897a8ad6ae78d11f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7b73719952876f4f9c0e6b4efe0027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d9bde16f3beda6b21defdcbea26a2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abb64932da4baf92322bc61ecf0df44f</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="ON/OFF Method">
      <data key="d0">ON/OFF Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The ON/OFF method is an optimization technique with discrete design parameters, used in conjunction with Genetic Algorithms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285619</data>
    </node>
