      <data key="d0">Evolutionary Algorithm</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of optimization technique, such as a Genetic Algorithm, that works well with discrete design parameters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
