    <node id="Magnetic Core">
      <data key="d0">Magnetic Core</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component in a C-core actuator made of soft magnetic material (M-19) designed to amplify and concentrate magnetic flux.&lt;SEP&gt;The Magnetic Core is represented by a complex, largely blue, solid structure in the right panel, reminiscent of a magnetic core within an electromagnetic field.&lt;SEP&gt;A Magnetic Core is a component whose design is being optimized through the sequence of sub-images, represented by a two-dimensional grid.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-68f5932d6d7a0e838c4c7ec90c8f340d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b76c5d19e7bcbbd5f11b71588e066f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9</data>
