    <node id="Curve-Fitting-Based Techniques">
      <data key="d0">Curve-Fitting-Based Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Curve-fitting-based techniques are approaches within data-driven modeling used to predict the performance of electric machines.&lt;SEP&gt;Curve-Fitting-Based Techniques are modeling approaches used to predict the performance of electric machines, often utilizing experimental or Finite Element model data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74285f9f1c2db4a1aaef011e90f166c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05d9b6a613299c6224fd2160377cbc33</data>
