      <data key="d0">Newton-Raphson Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Newton-Raphson Method is used to solve the nonlinear system of equations formulated in finite element analysis, especially due to nonlinear magnetic materials.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05d9b6a613299c6224fd2160377cbc33</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
