    <node id="CAP">
      <data key="d0">CAP</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Credit Assignment Path (CAP) is the chain of transformations from input to output; a CAP ≥ 3 indicates deep learning, and CAP ≥ 10 indicates very deep learning.</data>
