      <data key="d0">Liu, Mohammed, and Liu (2009)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Liu, Mohammed, and Liu (2009) are researchers cited in the context of FEM models being unsuitable for real-time simulation environments.</data>
