    <node id="Yilmaz and Krein (2008)">
      <data key="d0">Yilmaz and Krein (2008)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Yilmaz and Krein (2008) are researchers cited for their work on the advantages of the MEC method and the need for computationally cheap field solutions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-592244534b4a5f40cf1d7d58a26d28cc</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760285747</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Kim et al. (2002)">
      <data key="d0">Kim et al. (2002)</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Kim et al. (2002) are researchers whose work is cited regarding the popularity and extension of MEC to 3-D without rapid numerical complexity expansion.</data>
