      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ostovic 2012 is a reference that discusses the impossibility of finding an analytic solution for machine systems of differential equations and the application of the MEC method with numerical techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;A publication by Ostovic in 2012 defining flux tubes and stating how FEA provides flux distribution.</data>
