      <data key="d0">Dyck and Lowther 1996</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Dyck and Lowther 1996 applied Topology Optimization to electromagnetic (EM) fields and proposed the Optimized Material Distribution method.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6f3d168f1b6a8020e0606ef52cd19390</data>
