      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A paper published in "The bulletin of mathematical biophysics 5.4" in 1943, authored by Warren S McCulloch and Walter Pitts.&lt;SEP&gt;A logical calculus of the ideas immanent in nervous activity is a publication featured in "The bulletin of mathematical biophysics".</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c5f63a01dc7031890756e399578cff0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56168e4e7d535f0d2b13e88db7d37f2d</data>
