      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 3.18 illustrates two scenarios for knowledge transfer capability.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3.18 is a visual representation showing the discrepancy in geometrical features for external knowledge transfer.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 3.18 is a diagram titled "Transfer learning tasks: Internal Knowledge Transfer (IPM to IPM) and External Knowledge Transfer (IPM to PM)".</data>
