      <data key="d0">Data Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Data Requirements are factors related to the data needed for various methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Requirements refers to the amount of training data needed to successfully train a network.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5072e2b75e9621e87c85e7af0ee60311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f237e58ddc202b94dc8ea5b3ef7e3145</data>
