      <data key="d0">GA (Park and Min 2009b; Midha et al. 2019)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Genetic Algorithm (GA) is an optimization method used for comparison with A2C.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3cc8202063f67533ab2523d99cadd60f</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760286006</data>
    </node>
