      <data key="d0">Number of Simulation Calls</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A metric tabulated for comparison of optimization processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The number of simulation calls is a metric used to compare the computational efficiency of different optimization algorithms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b83022ca44128f92a414d02c9b7fc66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cc8202063f67533ab2523d99cadd60f</data>
