    </node>
    <node id="Alger 1970">
      <data key="d0">Alger 1970</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Alger 1970 refers to a publication that discusses challenges faced by analytical algorithms in approximating complex geometries and incorporating iron saturation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74285f9f1c2db4a1aaef011e90f166c0</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
