    </node>
    <node id="Hamdi 1994">
      <data key="d0">Hamdi 1994</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Hamdi 1994 refers to a publication that discusses challenges faced by analytical algorithms in approximating complex geometries and incorporating iron saturation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74285f9f1c2db4a1aaef011e90f166c0</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760286015</data>
