    <node id="Sheikh-Ghalavand, Vaez-Zadeh, and Isfahani 2009">
      <data key="d0">Sheikh-Ghalavand, Vaez-Zadeh, and Isfahani 2009</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Sheikh-Ghalavand, Vaez-Zadeh, and Isfahani 2009 refers to a publication that highlights the significance of approximating complex geometries and incorporating iron saturation for estimating magnetic fields and losses of motors.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-74285f9f1c2db4a1aaef011e90f166c0</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760286016</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Ray et al. 1984">
      <data key="d0">Ray et al. 1984</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Ray et al. 1984 refers to a publication supporting the use of analytic models for fast prototyping evaluated on global performance quantities.</data>
