      <data key="d0">Induction Motors (IMs)</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Induction Motors (IMs) have been an industry standard for decades, offering lower power density and efficiency compared to SynRMs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5526ac278068ab9cbf72c11fd3817672</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
