    <node id="Magnetic Flux Lines">
      <data key="d0">Magnetic Flux Lines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Magnetic flux lines are channeled into the armature, increasing the magnitude of magnetic flux and force.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Flux Lines are visual representations of the path and strength of the magnetic field, depicted as black contour lines in the image.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Flux Lines are black lines superimposed on the magnetic field distribution, indicating the direction and density of the magnetic field.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6719c866b8100236897a8ad6ae78d11f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5526ac278068ab9cbf72c11fd3817672&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0534c4408a52c608a5a24ccf9951f5f1</data>
