      <data key="d0">Eqn. 4.14</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Eqn. 4.14 is a specific equation mentioned in the text, likely defining the objective function $f(a)$.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b63cf0d438e93eb8fd05fc3ffbbb91e</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
