      <data key="d0">Table 4.5</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Table 4.5 contains geometric and excitation parameters used in the optimization processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Table 4.5, titled 'SynRM fixed parameters,' lists 10 essential geometric and electrical specifications of a Synchronous Reluctance Motor (SynRM) used as a baseline for topology optimization experiments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6b63cf0d438e93eb8fd05fc3ffbbb91e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f519dcf3231dec106e81c35523ed6914</data>
