      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 4.28a displays the conventional design of the SynRM from which baseline performance was extracted.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4.28a is a figure mentioned in the text that illustrates the conventional design with a torque of 2.5 N-m.</data>
