    <node id="Figure 4.30a">
      <data key="d0">Figure 4.30a</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 4.30a displays the optimal topology of the rotor obtained through TD-learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 4.30a is a visual representation of the resultant geometry mentioned in the context of the optimized SynRM.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b6f3bea48fce928809f6ddf7db422c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b63cf0d438e93eb8fd05fc3ffbbb91e</data>
