      <data key="d2">A probabilistic component in neuron weights extends a Deep Learning model to provide uncertainty measures.&lt;SEP&gt;A Deep Learning Model is used to predict magnetic field estimation in transformers, trained using data generated by varying transformer parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Deep Learning Model is the subject of the analysis, characterized by its architecture and trained using the specified dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of machine learning model mentioned in the surrounding context as being evaluated for its performance in classifying efficiency values.</data>
