      <data key="d2">Figure 5.4 provides an example where some states have similar features but drastically different returns.&lt;SEP&gt;States are represented by a vertically elongated, rounded-corner rectangle on the left side of the diagram, containing three smaller rectangular boxes labeled 'S_0', 'S_1', and 'S_2'.</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
