      <data key="d0">Convolutional Weights W</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46</data>
      <data key="d2">The posterior distribution over convolutional weights given input (X).</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760286983</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Intractability">
      <data key="d0">Intractability</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289a72546a02d10d2aa4147957dfa515</data>
      <data key="d2">The evidence term P(X) is very difficult to compute.&lt;SEP&gt;Intractability refers to the computational challenge associated with directly calculating or sampling from the posterior distribution p(W | X, Y).</data>
