      <data key="d2">The optimal geometry for a 3x3 SeqTO environment is shown in Figure 5.8.&lt;SEP&gt;Figure 5.8 showcases the optimal geometry of a C-core, achieved using Deep Q-Learning with a 3x3 controller and linear iron material, as well as a graph titled "Exponentially Average Reward" versus "Episodes Count."</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
