    <node id="Actions">
      <data key="d0">Actions</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d164a774e2261a7031fb600ad6568887&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bc9886b92f8e393e3ab3d494b9db33c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28d95920dc2d89112c02d6c86f6d7e2</data>
      <data key="d2">The trajectory of experience consists of actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Actions are represented by a vertically elongated, rounded-corner rectangle on the right side of the diagram, containing four smaller rectangular boxes labeled 'a_0', 'a_1', 'a_2', and 'a_3'.&lt;SEP&gt;Actions are specific responses or operations taken in a given state, such as 'a0' and 'a2', as shown in Table 4.2.</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289315</data>
    </node>
