      <data key="d2">The number of simulation calls is tabulated for each optimization process.&lt;SEP&gt;The Optimization Process involves considering specific locations or cells, as indicated by the 'Pointer', in conjunction with the 'Design Domain' to achieve optimal performance for the C-core controller.&lt;SEP&gt;The optimization process is a sequence of steps aimed at achieving the optimal geometry for excitation in a magnetic core design.&lt;SEP&gt;The Optimization Process is depicted by the sequence of sub-images, where material is consumed and "lives" are used over steps, aiming for an optimal configuration.</data>
