      <data key="d0">Midha Et Al. (2019)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Midha et al. (2019) refers to a research publication or group whose topology optimization results are used for comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;Midha et al. (2019) refers to a research publication describing the GA+filters method.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-af2139266a69c7c4fede66d615ca0684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a38c88cccaef550c4d3cde6f591d2fe5</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288782</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Tabular QL (Using SeqTO-v1)">
      <data key="d0">Tabular QL (Using SeqTO-v1)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tabular QL (Using SeqTO-v1) is an optimization method utilizing the Tabular Q-Learning algorithm with Sequence-based Topology Optimization version 1 (SeqTO-v1).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a38c88cccaef550c4d3cde6f591d2fe5</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288783</data>
    </node>
    <node id="A2C (RL Based; Using SeqTO-v2)">
      <data key="d0">A2C (RL Based; Using SeqTO-v2)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A2C (RL Based; Using SeqTO-v2) is a reinforcement learning-based optimization method using the Actor-Critic (A2C) agent with Sequence-based Topology Optimization version 2 (SeqTO-v2).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a38c88cccaef550c4d3cde6f591d2fe5</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
