      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A2C (Re-Train) is a fine-tuned version of the A2C agent, utilizing re-training or transfer learning concepts, demonstrating significantly reduced FE calls.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a38c88cccaef550c4d3cde6f591d2fe5</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
