    <node id="L-Shaped Arm">
      <data key="d0">L-Shaped Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The L-shaped arm is a component of the C-core geometry, extending from the left and forming a gap with a horizontal base.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d8330ecbeee1c4ebe7ea64bfd7fbb45b</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
