      <data key="d2">This is a transformation step where the output of the Convolutional Neural Network is converted into a one-dimensional vector.&lt;SEP&gt;Flattened to 1D Vector is a processing step where the output of the Convolutional Neural Network is converted into a one-dimensional vector.</data>
