    <node id="States (S0, S1, S2)">
      <data key="d0">States (S0, S1, S2)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">States represent distinct conditions or situations within a reinforcement learning environment, labeled as S0, S1, and S2 in the Q-table example.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceb1ac6e54fec53c601d8b38f2b338d</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288972</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Actions (a0, a1, a2, a3)">
      <data key="d0">Actions (a0, a1, a2, a3)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Actions are the possible operations an agent can perform from a given state, labeled a0, a1, a2, and a3 in the Q-table example.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceb1ac6e54fec53c601d8b38f2b338d</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288972</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Optimal Action">
      <data key="d0">Optimal Action</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An optimal action is the action that yields the highest Q-value for a given state, indicating the most favorable choice according to the Q-table.&lt;SEP&gt;The specific action $a^*$ chosen from the set of all possible actions that results in the maximum value of the Q-function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceb1ac6e54fec53c601d8b38f2b338d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e0300f86edc3c358dfc2a9374e88a8</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288975</data>
    </node>
    <node id="S0">
      <data key="d0">S0</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">S0 is one of the states listed in the Q-table, with Q-values associated with different actions.&lt;SEP&gt;S0 represents a specific state in the Q-table where actions a0, a1, a2, and a3 can be taken.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ceb1ac6e54fec53c601d8b38f2b338d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca0b752852f034cec7766c7e6e92af67</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760288975</data>
