    <node id="Magnetic Flux Distribution">
      <data key="d0">Magnetic Flux Distribution</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Magnetic Flux Distribution illustrates the magnitude of the magnetic flux density within the Synchronous Reluctance Motor (SynRM) structure using a color gradient and contour lines.&lt;SEP&gt;Magnetic Flux Distribution illustrates how magnetic flux density is spread across the Synchronous Reluctance Motor (SynRM), shown in panel (b) of Figure 4.30.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2b7b73719952876f4f9c0e6b4efe0027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b56c95146eb3d0e8591ffefd6ab679ea</data>
