      <data key="d0">SynRM Stator</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The SynRM Stator is the outer stationary part of the Synchronous Reluctance Motor, partially visible in Panel (a) and (b).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b56c95146eb3d0e8591ffefd6ab679ea</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
