    <node id="Sequential Topology Optimization - Q-Learning (SeqTO-QL)">
      <data key="d0">Sequential Topology Optimization - Q-Learning (SeqTO-QL)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Sequential Topology Optimization - Q-Learning (SeqTO-QL) is an optimization methodology for designing an electromagnetic actuator, represented in row (b) of Figure 5.21.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b984e4831b11f20f84bb8669cd7396b</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
