      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">5 × 5 (Non-linear) specifies the discretization of the design space, representing a specific grid resolution for the optimization problem.&lt;SEP&gt;This refers to the discretized design space for the SynRM rotor, implying a non-linear material model.</data>
