    <node id="4.9 Comparison between ON/OFF &amp; SeqTO-v1">
      <data key="d0">4.9 Comparison between ON/OFF &amp; SeqTO-v1</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">This section discusses the advantages of Sequence-based Topology Optimization, including its efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b6f3bea48fce928809f6ddf7db422c4</data>
