      <data key="d2">The 2D Grid is the overall composition of the diagram, consisting of numerous small, empty white squares outlined in black, representing discretized cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A 2D Grid is a visual structural representation predominantly white with cells filled with gray or red, illustrating the design domain.</data>
