    </node>
    <node id="Controller's Sequential Movements">
      <data key="d0">Controller's Sequential Movements</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">This refers to the discrete steps and actions of a controller, aligning with the Markov Decision Process (MDP) framework in the context of topology optimization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ad46225ae0d5f3835a9bda1ed8158d48</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
