      <data key="d0">pi</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Pi ($\pi$) is a symbol representing a deterministic policy in the context of Markov Decision Processes and Reinforcement Learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Pi (π) often represents a policy in the context of reinforcement learning, mapping states to actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-620c2ed72be858c05e569ae1452705a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8e2c74dbd2fe78b4f64f43cd17e839</data>
