    <node id="Optimal Control">
      <data key="d0">Optimal Control</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Optimal Control is a theoretical field related to artificial intelligence where deterministic control policies are a cornerstone.&lt;SEP&gt;Optimal control is a field concerned with finding a control law for a given system that minimizes a cost function or maximizes a reward function.&lt;SEP&gt;A method of control theory in which a control policy is chosen to minimize a cost function or maximize a reward function over time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-146167a8b3388ece49f9a67ad320dd0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58674fc78b8e0f9b48c3a573d49dd684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8e2c74dbd2fe78b4f64f43cd17e839</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289112</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Material Connectivity">
      <data key="d0">Material Connectivity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Material connectivity refers to the connection of materials in a design, which is a constraint in Topology Optimization that the approach ensures.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5c8e2c74dbd2fe78b4f64f43cd17e839</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289113</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Performance Measure: Avg |B|">
      <data key="d0">Performance Measure: Avg |B|</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">This represents the average magnetic field strength, stated as the key performance indicator for the C-core controller, explicitly used for optimization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-31fcb301590d668517d7e9583a508d90</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289114</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Grid-Based Design Space">
      <data key="d0">Grid-Based Design Space</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The conceptual framework used for the design and optimization of the C-core controller, characterized by a gridded domain.</data>
