      <data key="d0">Grids (a), (b), (c)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">These are three distinct sub-images within Figure 5.4, arranged horizontally, each representing a different state in a sequential process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5f031035d088ffa5bcc3e370fe22c958</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
