      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">RIGHT is one of the eight possible actions, specifically labeled for action a₈.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66f8a9943508aa952a9845858b8d3374</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
