      <data key="d2">Hidden Layer #2 is a layer within the neural network diagram, located to the right of Hidden Layer #1 and enclosed in a light blue rounded rectangle, containing four circular nodes labeled 'H₂₁' through 'H₂₄'.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ca632ae39508b7c6fdf1ad04973857b9</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
