    <node id="Experience Collection &amp; Learning">
      <data key="d0">Experience Collection &amp; Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'Experience Collection &amp; Learning' section is one of the two primary sections of the Q-Learning cycle, focused on gathering and processing experiences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11cc1c9381d2b807e25d94ba609ca1ea</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289405</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Experience Buffer (S, R, A, S')">
      <data key="d0">Experience Buffer (S, R, A, S')</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'Experience Buffer (S, R, A, S')' is a component that stores collected experiences, represented as state, reward, action, and next state tuples.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11cc1c9381d2b807e25d94ba609ca1ea</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289405</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Q-Network (Target)">
      <data key="d0">Q-Network (Target)</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The 'Q-Network (Target)' is a neural network that is trained using processed experiences, receiving knowledge sharing from Q-Learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11cc1c9381d2b807e25d94ba609ca1ea</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289405</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Q-Network (Behaviour)">
      <data key="d0">Q-Network (Behaviour)</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Q-Network (Behaviour) is a neural network component in the Decision Making section that receives state input, processes Q-values, and receives knowledge sharing and weight updates.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11cc1c9381d2b807e25d94ba609ca1ea</data>
      <data key="d4">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d5">1760289405</data>
    </node>
