    <node id="Q(s, a_4)">
      <data key="d0">Q(s, a_4)</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Q(s, a_4) represents a Q-value for a specific state-action pair, corresponding to the action 'RIGHT'.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-11cc1c9381d2b807e25d94ba609ca1ea</data>
