    <node id="Nabla">
      <data key="d0">Nabla</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Nabla represents the gradient operator, used to calculate the direction of the steepest ascent.&lt;SEP&gt;Nabla ($\nabla$) is a vector differential operator, typically used to denote the gradient of a multivariable function.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-19afc62597694db2255ea53cb7e6f242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd1039c6984ae2b3caedcb109bdc272a</data>
