    <edge source="Q-Learning" target="Policy Gradient Algorithm">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Unlike Q-learning, the Policy Gradient algorithm is an on-policy algorithm and does not have an 'Experience Replay' memory.&lt;SEP&gt;Unlike Q-learning, the Policy Gradient (PG) algorithm is an on-policy algorithm with different training characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;The update rule is explicitly contrasted with Q-learning's update rule.</data>
