    <edge source="Q-Learning" target="Optimal Policy">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Q-Learning aims to learn an Optimal Policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-Learning aims to learn the Optimal Policy by estimating the optimal $Q(s,a)$ function.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-Learning aims to learn the optimal action-value function from which an optimal policy can be derived.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-Learning aims to achieve an Optimal Policy.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-learning aims to learn an optimal policy by estimating the optimal action-value function ($Q(s, a)$).&lt;SEP&gt;Q-Learning is used to learn an optimal policy for an agent within an environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">achieves,goal,learning goal,learning objective,learning outcome,learns,mechanism,objective,outcome,seeks</data>
