    <edge source="Q-Learning" target="Exploration-Exploitation Dilemma">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Q-Learning addresses the Exploration-Exploitation Dilemma.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-Learning, in conjunction with action-selection strategies, addresses the Exploration-Exploitation Dilemma.&lt;SEP&gt;Q-learning provides the value estimates needed to address the exploration-exploitation dilemma in reinforcement learning.</data>
