    <edge source="Controller" target="SeqTO-v1">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The SeqTO-v1 methodology incorporates the movement of a controller to optimize material distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;SeqTO-v1 is a sequence-based controller employed on a discretized space.</data>
