      <data key="d11">1760286714</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Controller" target="Material Distribution">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The movement of the controller aims to optimize material distribution in the design space.&lt;SEP&gt;The controller interprets current material distribution to make rational decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Controller is the primary mechanism for the process of Material Distribution.</data>
      <data key="d8">decision making,interpretation,mechanism,movement,optimization,process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-51ad9a81904dfb8134371112a0be9fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d610c2b7090b4469e2b4b784c49c5807</data>
