    </edge>
    <edge source="Magnetic Saturation" target="SeqTOv2 Methodology">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The inflexibility of SeqTOv2 methodology hinders placing thin strips near the air gap, affecting saturation management.</data>
