    <edge source="Stochastic Policy" target="Deterministic Policy">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A deterministic policy is contrasted with a stochastic policy based on action selection.&lt;SEP&gt;A deterministic policy is differentiated from a stochastic policy by its selection of a single action.&lt;SEP&gt;The equation and its resulting deterministic policy are contrasted with a stochastic policy used by A2C.</data>
