    </edge>
    <edge source="Dropout" target="Parameter &quot;P&quot;">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The parameter 'p' determines the probability of dropping out any neuron from the network in Dropout.</data>
      <data key="d8">component,influence</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286978</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dropout" target="Uncertainty Information">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Uncertainty information can be extracted from models using dropout without additional parameters.</data>
      <data key="d8">benefit,extraction</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286982</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dropout" target="Monte Carlo Sampling">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Performing dropout during the test phase can be viewed as Monte Carlo sampling.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,method</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286984</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dropout" target="Bernoulli Distribution">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Applying dropout to weight layers draws weight from a Bernoulli distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;Dropout imposes a Bernoulli distribution over CNN filter's weights.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,distribution type,imposition,underlying principle</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de8952c3b21b80d4712abc62f00e8c46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c2729bc0700da0250623cae161a1895</data>
