    </edge>
    <edge source="Dropout" target="Bayesian Inference">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Dropout can be cast as approximate Bayesian inference over the network’s weights.&lt;SEP&gt;Dropout can be cast as approximate Bayesian inference.</data>
