    <edge source="TD-Learning" target="Bootstrapping">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">TD-learning is a bootstrapping-based method.&lt;SEP&gt;TD-Learning utilizes bootstrapping to estimate future returns.&lt;SEP&gt;TD-learning uses bootstrapping in its value updates.</data>
      <data key="d8">foundation,method,methodology,technique,uses</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-34ed3729fa06a3c6f2093a4d16a2c572&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a19e84f4051b2d1d639403e518dc4ebb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c28d95920dc2d89112c02d6c86f6d7e2</data>
