    <edge source="SeqTO-v2" target="A2C">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The relation "(A2C, SeqTO-v2)" indicates that A2C is based on SeqTO-v2. Specifically, A2C relies on the SeqTO-v2 methodology for optimization tasks. This foundational relationship means that SeqTO-v2 serves as the basis for A2C's operational framework.

SeqTO-v2 plays a crucial role in enabling A2C to determine optimal geometry and B distribution. The A2C agent specifically utilizes SeqTO-v2 for its optimization processes, ensuring that A2C achieves optimal geometry in its applications. It is also noted that SeqTO-v2 provides a different level of granularity compared to its predecessor, SeqTO-v1, which was a QL-based method.</data>
      <data key="d8">based on,basis for,compared to,development,granularity level,implementation,method,method basis,method combination,method environment,method origin,methodology,optimization,used for</data>
