    </edge>
    <edge source="Homogenization Methods" target="Optimal Shape">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">In homogenization methods, the optimal shape of the structure is transformed into an optimization problem for ideal material distribution.</data>
      <data key="d8">methodology,transformation</data>
