      <data key="d11">1760286823</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Optimization Problem" target="Equation">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Equation defines inequality constraints for the optimization problem.&lt;SEP&gt;The Equation represents an Optimization Problem.</data>
      <data key="d8">constraint,definition,representation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-14506e8e02aeb799dcd49d4b24c5b529&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d9bde16f3beda6b21defdcbea26a2a</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292799</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Optimization Problem" target="Objective Function f(a)">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Objective Function f(a) is an integral part of the Optimization Problem and is to be minimized.&lt;SEP&gt;The objective function f(a) is minimized as part of the optimization problem.</data>
