    </edge>
    <edge source="Q(s, a)" target="Equation">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The policy defined by the equation is derived directly from the action-value function Q(s, a).&lt;SEP&gt;Q(s, a) is a function that is being maximized in the equation.&lt;SEP&gt;The equation defines a variable `a*` through the maximization of the function `Q(s, a)`.</data>
      <data key="d8">component,defines,derivation,function,optimizes</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-58674fc78b8e0f9b48c3a573d49dd684&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3c16dd3211cf28f9ec77da01f786ee6</data>
