    </edge>
    <edge source="State" target="Markov Property">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Markov property dictates that future states and rewards depend only on the current state, and the present state is sufficient.</data>
      <data key="d8">independence,sufficiency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286965</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="State" target="Transition State">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The algorithm learns the transition from one state (s_t) to another (s').</data>
      <data key="d8">change,progression</data>
