      <data key="d11">1760286966</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="State" target="Action">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">State transition and reward function are dependent on the current state and the chosen action.&lt;SEP&gt;An Action is taken in a given State.&lt;SEP&gt;Action probabilities are determined given a specific state, creating a dependency between state and action.</data>
      <data key="d8">conditional dependency,context,dependency,influence,interaction,mapping</data>
