    <edge source="Weights" target="Function">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The learning algorithm uses its own estimate of the value function to update its prediction, adjusting weights (w) of the neural network predicting the action-value function Q(s,a). This is determined by the gradient of the loss function (Eq. 5.1).</data>
