    <edge source="Hidden Layer" target="Artificial Neural Network">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An Artificial Neural Network has hidden layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Hidden Layers are integral components of an Artificial Neural Network, performing intermediate computations.</data>
      <data key="d8">component,part of,structure</data>
