    <edge source="Temporal Difference Learning" target="Weight Update Rule">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Weight Update Rule is an implementation of Temporal Difference Learning for function approximation.&lt;SEP&gt;The core of the update rule is based on Temporal Difference (TD) Learning.</data>
