    <edge source="Temporal Difference Learning" target="SARSA">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">SARSA is a Temporal Difference learning algorithm based on concepts discussed in relation to the Gt equation.&lt;SEP&gt;SARSA is a variant of Temporal Difference Learning.</data>
