    <edge source="Temporal Difference Learning" target="Bootstrapping">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Temporal Difference learning is characterized by bootstrapping, using estimates of future returns to update current estimates.&lt;SEP&gt;Temporal Difference Learning relies on bootstrapping.</data>
      <data key="d8">characteristic,method,principle</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-87755691ed2aadfe9652dad2d067f4a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c35bf46c88c50e423b73a91a41f7f95a</data>
