    <edge source="Agent" target="Penalty">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent can be penalized through a negative reward.&lt;SEP&gt;The agent receives a penalty for moving out of the design domain.</data>
      <data key="d8">consequence,receive,reception</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Origin">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Losing a life places the controller (agent) back at the origin.</data>
      <data key="d8">location reset,move back</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286218</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Magnetic Material">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">After losing a life and returning to the origin, the agent adds magnetic material where the design is affected by magnetic saturation.&lt;SEP&gt;The agent adds magnetic material in a region where saturation is severe.</data>
      <data key="d8">action,adds</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2c2f32fec14ff1bde53b19699374993</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286219</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Policy">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent forms a policy to tackle the phenomenon of material non-linearity.</data>
      <data key="d8">decision-making,forms</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286222</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Optimal Design">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Based on its action, the agent concludes that the optimal design does not deviate much for higher excitation.</data>
      <data key="d8">concludes,outcome</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286223</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Topology">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent shows a significant change in topology for lower values of excitation.</data>
      <data key="d8">action,shows change</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286224</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Optimal Structure">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent's inability to reach the optimal structure can be partially explained by the inflexibility of SeqTOv2.</data>
      <data key="d8">inability to reach,limitation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-12274febd6bccf438d9cbc6fce42afe1</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286235</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Environment">
      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent takes actions in the environment and receives feedback from it.&lt;SEP&gt;The online nature of data is attributed to the constant interaction of the agent with the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The transitional change in the design space is due to the interaction between the agent and the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Agent and Environment are connected by thick black arrows, indicating a feedback loop of observation and action.</data>
      <data key="d8">context,feedback loop,interaction,learning,system behavior</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9360ea49ebcfafb62140f053dfc1f70c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2c2f32fec14ff1bde53b19699374993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9b48425c0c345b3be14ed824c6579b7</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292150</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Exploration">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Exploration helps the agent get a more accurate estimate of its value function.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent needs to try many different actions in numerous states for exploration.</data>
      <data key="d8">activity,decision-making,learning,strategy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e1757cd493f052e1f9528255eb34ea59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de02f58d9cc1d404c5da9c1f45b14fa6</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286871</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Exploitation">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Exploitation allows the agent a higher chance of getting more reward.&lt;SEP&gt;An agent must use the information it learned from experience (Exploitation).</data>
      <data key="d8">activity,decision-making,reward maximization,strategy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e1757cd493f052e1f9528255eb34ea59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de02f58d9cc1d404c5da9c1f45b14fa6</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286873</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Reward ($r_t$ )">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent's goal is to maximize the reward.</data>
      <data key="d8">goal,maximization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286953</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Action ($\boldsymbol{u}$)">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent takes actions which influence rewards and future states.</data>
      <data key="d8">choice,execution</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286955</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Reward Formulation">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The reward function communicates to the agent what to achieve.</data>
      <data key="d8">communication,guidance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286958</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Immediate Reward">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agent's learning balances short-term immediate rewards.</data>
      <data key="d8">balance,goal</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7545e109d55e050bca56ba6604cda3ae</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760286959</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agent" target="Cumulative Reward">
