    <edge source="Exploration" target="Epsilon-Greedy">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Epsilon-greedy is a method for choosing to explore based on the parameter epsilon.&lt;SEP&gt;Epsilon-greedy is used for exploration in both off-policy and on-policy learning.</data>
