    </edge>
    <edge source="Exploration" target="Epsilon">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A higher value of epsilon leads to more exploration by the agent.&lt;SEP&gt;Epsilon represents the probability of choosing a random action, driving exploration.</data>
