    </edge>
    <edge source="Electromagnetic Problem" target="Complex Geometries">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Finding a field solution on a complex geometry, such as an electric machine, adds to the complexity of an electromagnetic problem.</data>
