      <data key="d7">The update for the Q-learning algorithm was based on the bootstrapped action value ($R + Q(s', a')$).</data>
      <data key="d8">basis,update mechanism</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7133594b2e19b403575b42aef1cafffb</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287072</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Learning Algorithm" target="Epsilon Parameter">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">In QL, exploration is based on the value of the epsilon parameter.</data>
      <data key="d8">exploration,mechanism</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7133594b2e19b403575b42aef1cafffb</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287074</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Learning Algorithm" target="Figure 5.16 (A)">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Figure 5.16 (a) demonstrates the Q-Learning algorithm's greedy policy.</data>
      <data key="d8">greedy policy,illustration</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7133594b2e19b403575b42aef1cafffb</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287076</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Learning Algorithm" target="Experience Replay Memory">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Unlike Q-learning (DQN), PG does not use experience replay memory.</data>
      <data key="d8">absence,distinction</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7133594b2e19b403575b42aef1cafffb</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287077</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Learning Algorithm" target="Equation">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Q-Learning algorithm uses this equation to derive an optimal policy.</data>
      <data key="d8">derivation,mechanism</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-58674fc78b8e0f9b48c3a573d49dd684</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292105</data>
    </edge>
