    <edge source="Action-Value Function" target="Critic Network">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The action-value function is a learned estimate provided by the Critic network.&lt;SEP&gt;The Critic Network provides evaluation in the form of Q-value network.</data>
