    <edge source="Action-Value Function" target="Weight Update Rule">
      <data key="d6">3.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The weight update rule is used for estimating action-value functions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Weight Update Rule adjusts weights to improve the estimation of the Action-Value Function.&lt;SEP&gt;The weight update rule updates parameters of a neural network that approximates the action-value function.</data>
