      <data key="d11">1760291613</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Value" target="State-Value Function">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A Q-Value is the sum of the State-Value Function (V) of the next state.</data>
      <data key="d8">component,definition</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3cc8202063f67533ab2523d99cadd60f</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287257</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Q-Value" target="Advantage Actor-Critic (A2C)">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The A2C version might seem to make learning more complex as it needs to learn Q(s,a).</data>
      <data key="d8">complexity,learning</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3cc8202063f67533ab2523d99cadd60f</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760287259</data>
    </edge>
