    <edge source="Advantage Function" target="Actor-Critic Framework">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Advantage Function is a foundational concept implemented within the Actor-Critic Framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advantage function improves upon the Q-value in Actor-Critic to reduce variance.</data>
