    <edge source="Advantage Function" target="Gradient Calculation">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The advantage function provides a robust direction for gradient calculation in policy updates.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advantage function is more useful for gradient calculation than the Q-value, leading to more stable and efficient policy updates.</data>
