    </edge>
    <edge source="Monte Carlo Methods" target="Equation 1">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The formulation of Equation 1 with Gt+1 resembles a Monte Carlo-like definition where the return Gt+1 encompasses all subsequent rewards.</data>
