    </edge>
    <edge source="Policy Parameters" target="Gradient Ascent">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The update of policy parameters is a gradient ascent step aiming to maximize the expected return.</data>
      <data key="d8">objective,optimization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-298487c8d447bf081bcb2234cb4ddb80</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760289755</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Policy Parameters" target="Gradient Operator">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The gradient operator ($\nabla_\theta$) computes the direction of steepest ascent for the log-probability concerning the policy parameters.</data>
