      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The true posterior distribution $p(W|X,Y)$ is conditional on the input training data $X$.&lt;SEP&gt;The probability distribution p(W|X,Y) is conditional on the variable X.</data>
      <data key="d8">conditional on,dependency,distribution,input</data>
