    <edge source="Input Map" target="Receptive Field">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Receptive Field is a section within the Input Map that is actively processed by the kernel.&lt;SEP&gt;The receptive field is a specific 3x3 section within the input map that is actively processed by the convolutional kernel.</data>
      <data key="d8">containment,part of,processing,processing area</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d59e50443efd19bae755d63382e315bd</data>
