    <edge source="First Update Rule" target="Error Term">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Error Term $\Big[ G_t - Q_\pi(s_t, a_t) \Big]$ is calculated and reduced by the First Update Rule.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Update Rule uses the error term to update the Q-value.</data>
