      <data key="d11">1760292322</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Efficiency Map To Power Factor Map" target="Internal Permanent Magnet Motor">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The 'Efficiency map to Power factor map' task is performed in the context of an Internal Permanent Magnet Motor.</data>
      <data key="d8">application,context</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-248a0b72513cd485685d4b3e3864e01e</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292324</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="$a^* = \arg \operatorname*{max}_a Q(s, a)$" target="$a^*$">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">$a^*$ is the optimal action defined by the equation $a^* = \arg \operatorname*{max}_a Q(s, a)$.</data>
      <data key="d8">is defined by</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-29e0300f86edc3c358dfc2a9374e88a8</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292341</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="$a^* = \arg \operatorname*{max}_a Q(s, a)$" target="argmax Operator">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The `argmax` operator is a key mathematical operation used in the equation $a^* = \arg \operatorname*{max}_a Q(s, a)$.</data>
      <data key="d8">used in</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-29e0300f86edc3c358dfc2a9374e88a8</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292343</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Argmax" target="Q (s, a)">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Argmax operates on Q (s, a) to find the action that maximizes its value.</data>
      <data key="d8">input,maximization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-742edca401668538e3a7a9b93ec14162</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1760293095</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Half-Geometry" target="L-Shaped Region">
      <data key="d6">1.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The L-Shaped Region represents the core material within the Half-Geometry.</data>
      <data key="d8">represents,structural_component</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ca13e3ef7d4bf929b84d6b30574e3485</data>
      <data key="d10">Khan_Arbaaz_ECE_Thesis.pdf</data>
      <data key="d11">1760292360</data>
    </edge>
